Third-party components

This product depends on third-party components distributed under their own
licenses. The NAR-level NOTICE files listed above enumerate the components
bundled into each extension. Notable items:

* Debezium (Apache-2.0) — https://debezium.io/
  Embedded engine and the MySQL / PostgreSQL / Oracle / SQL Server connectors,
  bundled into the nifi-argus-debezium-* NARs.

* Delta Kernel (Apache-2.0) — https://delta.io/
  Bundled into the nifi-argus-deltalake NAR.

* Apache Iceberg, Apache Hive, Apache Hadoop, Apache Parquet, Apache ORC,
  Apache Avro, Apache Calcite, Apache Kudu, Apache ZooKeeper (all Apache-2.0)
  Bundled into the corresponding extension NARs.

* Cloudera JDBC Connector for Apache Hive — NOT bundled and NOT distributed.
  `VendorHive3ConnectionPool` references the driver class
  `com.cloudera.hive.jdbc.HS2Driver` by name only. Users who need that
  controller service must obtain the driver from the vendor themselves and
  install it into the NiFi `lib/` directory; it is subject to the vendor's own
  license terms. See nifi-extensions/nifi-argus-hive-bundle/README.md.

* Upstream container images (Apache NiFi) and the Apache NiFi binary
  distribution are pinned by version tag and downloaded at build time; they are
  not vendored into this repository.
